{"id":"vod_bf_16820","vodId":"16820","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"进击的巨人第二季","name_cn":"进击的巨人第二季","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-18/2e53682afd5d6e1d1141ceac7a69067e.jpg"},"summary":"自从人类的和平与幻想被超大型巨人打破的那天起，艾伦·耶格尔便每天持续着没有尽头的战斗。因为眼睁睁地看着无力抵抗的母亲被巨人吃掉，艾伦发誓要将世间的巨人一只不留地驱逐出去。但是，在严酷的战斗中，艾伦自己也变成了巨人。为了人类的自由，艾伦施展着巨人的力量，并在希娜之墙的史托黑斯区和女巨人发生了激烈的冲突。在这场巨人间的战斗中，艾伦最终胜出了。即便如此，艾伦以及人类的休息时刻也不会到来。下一轮的战斗已经宣告开始。对于逼近罗塞之墙的巨人大群，人类将如何面对？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 22:49:40","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendierji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendierji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendierji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendierji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendierji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendierji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendierji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendierji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendierji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendierji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendierji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendierji/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:41:06.785Z"}